; Regression test for issue #3313: on a commodity directive line, a ';'
; outside a quoted symbol ends the symbol and begins a comment, whether
; or not whitespace precedes it, just as a ';' ends a commodity after an
; amount in a posting.  A ';' written right after a bare symbol used to
; become part of the symbol, and the rest of the line was dropped:
; `commodity N2; foo` declared the commodity "N2;", so the format and
; alias under it, and --pedantic, never reached N2.

; The three headers from the report.  Each format names the commodity
; its header declares, and each alias shows which commodity that is.
commodity N1 ; foo
    format 1000.00 "N1"
    alias ONE

commodity N2; foo
    format 1000.00 "N2"
    alias TWO

commodity "N3; foo"
    format 1000.00 "N3; foo"
    alias THREE

; With no whitespace at all, and after a quoted symbol.
commodity USD;the US dollar
    alias DOLLAR

commodity "EUR";the euro
    alias EURO

; The historical @ and ! prefixes change nothing.
@commodity JPY;the yen
    alias YEN

!commodity CNY;the yuan
    alias YUAN

; As in an amount, a backslash puts a ';' into a bare symbol, so this
; format names the same commodity as its header.
commodity A\;B
    format 1.00 A\;B

; The N directive reads its symbol the same way.
N CHF; no price downloads

account Assets:Cash
account Equity

2024/01/01 Test
    Assets:Cash    1234.5 ONE
    Assets:Cash    1234.5 TWO
    Assets:Cash    1234.5 THREE
    Assets:Cash    10 DOLLAR
    Assets:Cash    10 EURO
    Assets:Cash    10 YEN
    Assets:Cash    10 YUAN
    Assets:Cash    1 "A;B"
    Assets:Cash    10 CHF
    Equity

test bal --flat Assets
            1.00 A;B
              10 CHF
              10 CNY
              10 EUR
              10 JPY
          1234.50 N1
          1234.50 N2
     1234.50 N3; foo
              10 USD  Assets:Cash
end test

; Every commodity posted is one a directive declared.
test --pedantic bal --flat Assets
            1.00 A;B
              10 CHF
              10 CNY
              10 EUR
              10 JPY
          1234.50 N1
          1234.50 N2
     1234.50 N3; foo
              10 USD  Assets:Cash
end test
